## Interface: 16001
## Title: Tracking Alert
## Notes: Pings when a tracked node blip or a GatherMate2 tracking circle appears on the minimap.
## Author: miyanko
## Version: 2.0.0
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Bell_01
## OptionalDeps: GatherMate2
## SavedVariables: TrackingAlertDB
## AddonCompartmentFunc: TrackingAlert_OnClick
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnEnter: TrackingAlert_OnEnter
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnLeave: TrackingAlert_OnLeave
## X-Category: Map & Minimap

# Load order is the dependency order: Config owns the saved settings, Alert owns the one alert output both
# sources share, Probe, Geometry and Scanner are the minimap blip source, GatherMate is the optional
# GatherMate2 source, and the UI files build on all of them.

Core\Config.lua
Core\Alert.lua
Core\Probe.lua
Core\Geometry.lua
Core\Scanner.lua
Core\GatherMate.lua
UI\Options.lua
UI\Compartment.lua
